<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>산불발생위험도 보고서</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #ffffff;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --surface-2: #f4f4f5;
    --ink: #111827;
    --ink-soft: #4b5563;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --line: #e5e7eb;
    --accent: #111827;
    --accent-strong: #111827;
    --accent-ink: #ffffff;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
    print-color-adjust: exact;
  }

  .doc { max-width: 100%; padding: 0 40px; }

  section.spread {
    padding: 28px 0 22px;
    break-after: page;
    page-break-after: always;
  }
  section.spread:last-of-type { break-after: auto; page-break-after: auto; }

  .sec-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .sec-dot {
    flex: none;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }
  .sec-head .titles { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }

  h1.page-title, h2.page-title {
    font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  h1.page-title { font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.25; }
  h2.page-title { font-size: 22px; }

  .lede { max-width: 70ch; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .lede.one-line { max-width: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .lede strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  p.copy { max-width: 70ch; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0; word-break: keep-all; overflow-wrap: normal; }
  p.copy strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .footnote { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 10px; }
  svg text { font-family: "Noto Sans KR", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif; }
  hr.rule {
    border: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin: 16px 0;
  }

  /* ---------- Cover ---------- */
  .cover-date { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .cover-grid { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  .cover-grid > .lede-col { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
  .cover-grid .lede { margin-bottom: 0; max-width: none; word-break: keep-all; }
  .gauge-wrap { position: relative; width: 400px; height: 400px; flex: none; margin-right: -40px; }
  .gauge-wrap svg { display: block; width: 400px; height: 400px; }
  .gauge-center {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 46%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 156px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .gauge-number { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; line-height: 1; }
  .gauge-scale { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }
  .gauge-band-label { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; padding: 4px 11px; border-radius: 999px; }

  .kpi-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .kpi {
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--surface);
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .kpi-head {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8px 10px;
  }
  .kpi-body { padding: 12px 12px 14px; text-align: center; }
  .kpi-desc { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); min-height: 1.4em; }
  .kpi-val { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; margin-top: 4px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .kpi-val small { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ---------- Ranking ---------- */
  .rank-list { column-count: 2; column-gap: 26px; }
  .rank-row {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 22px 118px minmax(0, 1fr) 36px;
    align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 3px 4px; break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .rank-row .r { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .rank-row .name { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .rank-row.top .name { color: var(--accent-strong); font-weight: 800; }
  .rank-row.highlight .name { text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--accent); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .rank-track { position: relative; height: 8px; background: var(--surface-2); border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; }
  .rank-fill { position: absolute; inset: 0 auto 0 0; border-radius: 999px; }
  .rank-row .val { font-size: 11.5px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .legend-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .legend-items {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, auto);
    gap: 6px 16px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .legend-item { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .legend-item .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; }
  .legend-hint { flex: none; text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }

  section.spread#p2 {
    min-height: 258mm;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  section.spread#p2 .legend-bar {
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  /* ---------- Comparison ---------- */
  .range-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 22px 22px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .range-strip { position: relative; height: 12px; border-radius: 999px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; margin: 40px 4px 26px; }
  .range-strip span { flex: 1; }
  .range-marker { position: absolute; top: -32px; transform: translateX(-50%); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; font-size: 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .range-marker .stem { width: 1px; height: 14px; background: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }
  .range-marker.emph .stem { background: var(--accent-strong); width: 2px; }
  .range-marker .lbl { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .range-marker.emph .lbl { color: var(--accent-strong); font-weight: 800; }
  .range-marker .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  .range-marker.below { top: auto; bottom: -32px; flex-direction: column-reverse; }
  .range-marker.below .stem { margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 2px; }

  .section-label { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 12px; font-weight: 700; }
  .prov-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
  .prov-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 84px minmax(0, 1fr) 42px; align-items: center; gap: 10px; break-inside: avoid; }
  .prov-row .name { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .prov-row.target .name { font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-strong); }
  .prov-track { position: relative; height: 12px; background: var(--surface-2); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  .prov-fill { position: absolute; inset: 0 auto 0 0; border-radius: 4px; }
  .prov-row.target .prov-fill { outline: 2px solid var(--accent-strong); outline-offset: -2px; }
  .prov-row .val { font-size: 11.5px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .badge { font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; background: var(--accent); color: var(--accent-ink); border-radius: 999px; padding: 1px 7px; }

  /* ---------- Spotlight rows ---------- */
  .spot-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .spot-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 248px;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px 16px;
    background: var(--surface);
    break-inside: avoid;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .spot-main { min-width: 0; }
  .spot-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .spot-rank { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-weight: 700; }
  .spot-name { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .spot-head .chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); }
  .spot-head .swatch { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .spot-idx { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--accent-strong); line-height: 1; margin: 4px 0 10px; }
  .spot-idx small { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .compare { position: relative; height: 6px; background: var(--surface-2); border-radius: 999px; margin: 22px 2px 26px; }
  .compare i { position: absolute; top: -6px; width: 2px; height: 16px; background: var(--muted); }
  .compare i.self { background: var(--accent-strong); width: 3px; }
  .compare em { position: absolute; top: -20px; transform: translateX(-50%); font-style: normal; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }
  .compare em.self { color: var(--accent-strong); font-weight: 800; }
  .compare em.below { top: auto; bottom: -18px; }

  .wx-mini {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .wx-mini th {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 7px 4px 2px;
  }
  .wx-mini td {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2px 4px 8px;
  }
  .wx-mini td small { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }

  section.spread#p4 {
    min-height: 250mm;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* ---------- Methodology ---------- */
  .method-grid { display: flex; gap: 36px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .method-grid > div { flex: 1 1 0; min-width: 0; }
  .stat-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .stat-line span:first-child { color: var(--muted); }
  .stat-line span:last-child { font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  ul.guide { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  ul.guide li { display: flex; gap: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  ul.guide li::before { content: ""; flex: none; width: 6px; height: 6px; margin-top: 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--accent); }

  .report-footer {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 2px;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .report-footer strong { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  section.spread:last-of-type {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 258mm;
    display: block;
    padding-bottom: 56px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="doc">

  <!-- 1: 표지 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p1">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h1 class="page-title">산불발생위험도 보고서</h1>
        <p class="cover-date">{{ predict_date }}{% if weekday %} {{ weekday }}요일{% endif %} · 기상관측 {{ observed_at }} 기준 · ML 예측모델</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cover-grid">
      <div class="lede-col">
        <p class="lede">{{ narrative.cover }}{% if narrative.cover_avg %}<br />{{ narrative.cover_avg }}{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gauge-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="-90 -80 480 460" width="400" height="400" role="img" aria-label="{{ province }} 평균 산불위험지수 {{ province_stat.avg }}, 100점 만점">
          {% for arc in gauge.arcs %}
          <path d="{{ arc.path }}" stroke="{{ arc.color }}" stroke-width="22" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          {% endfor %}

          <line x1="150" y1="150" x2="{{ gauge.needle.x }}" y2="{{ gauge.needle.y }}" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="8" fill="var(--ink)"/>

          {% for t in gauge.ticks %}
          <text x="{{ t.x }}" y="{{ t.y + 4 }}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="10" fill="var(--muted)">{{ t.v }}</text>
          {% endfor %}

          {% for c in gauge.captions %}
          <line x1="{{ c.dot_x }}" y1="{{ c.dot_y }}" x2="{{ c.bx }}" y2="{{ c.by }}" stroke="#4b5563" stroke-width="1.3"/>
          <circle cx="{{ c.dot_x }}" cy="{{ c.dot_y }}" r="4.5" fill="#fff" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="2"/>
          <rect x="{{ c.rx }}" y="{{ c.ry }}" width="{{ c.rw }}" height="{{ c.rh }}" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#111827" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <text x="{{ c.bx }}" y="{{ c.ty }}" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#111827">{{ c.text }}</text>
          {% endfor %}
        </svg>
        <div class="gauge-center">
          <div class="gauge-number">{{ "%.1f"|format(province_stat.avg) }}</div>
          <div class="gauge-scale">{{ province }} 평균 · 100점 만점</div>
          <div class="gauge-band-label" style="background:{{ province_stat.band_color }}; color:{{ province_stat.band_text }};">{{ province_stat.band_lo }}–{{ province_stat.band_hi }} 구간</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="rule" />

    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">오늘의 기상 조건</h2>
        <p class="lede">{{ narrative.weather_note }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">기온</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.temp_min) }} ~ {{ "%.1f"|format(weather.temp_max) }}{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.temp_avg) }}<small> ℃</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">습도</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}{{ weather.humidity_min|round|int }} ~ {{ weather.humidity_max|round|int }}%{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ weather.humidity_avg|round|int }}<small> %</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">풍속</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.wind_min) }} ~ {{ "%.1f"|format(weather.wind_max) }}{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.wind_avg) }}<small> m/s</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi-head">강수</div>
        <div class="kpi-body">
          <div class="kpi-desc">{% if weather.uniform %}대표 관측{% else %}최대 {{ "%.1f"|format(weather.precip_max) }} mm{% endif %}</div>
          <div class="kpi-val">{{ "%.1f"|format(weather.precip_avg) }}<small> mm</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="copy" style="margin-top:14px">{{ narrative.weather_desc }}</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 2: 지역별 순위 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p2">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">지역별 산불위험지수 순위</h2>
        <p class="lede">{{ narrative.rank_summary }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rank-list">
      {% for row in ranking %}
      <div class="rank-row{% if row.is_top %} top{% endif %}{% if row.is_highlight %} highlight{% endif %}">
        <span class="r">{{ row.rank }}</span>
        <span class="name">{{ row.name }}</span>
        <div class="rank-track"><div class="rank-fill" style="width:{{ row.width_pct }}%; background:{{ row.color }}"></div></div>
        <span class="val">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.idx) }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="legend-bar">
      <div class="legend-items">
        {% for b in band_legend %}
        <span class="legend-item"><span class="dot" style="background:{{ b.color }}"></span>{{ b.lo }}–{{ b.hi }} 구간</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <span class="legend-hint">막대 길이 = 위험지수(0–100 기준) · 동일 지수는 같은 순위 · 나열은 가나다순</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3: 전국 비교 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p3">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        {% if is_national %}
        <h2 class="page-title">전국 17개 시·도별 산불위험지수 비교</h2>
        <p class="lede">전국 {{ national.count }}개 시·군·구를 시·도 단위로 묶어 평균을 비교했습니다.</p>
        {% else %}
        <h2 class="page-title">{{ province }}{{ province_eun_neun }} 전국 {{ province_stat.count }}개 시·도 중 {{ province_stat.rank }}위</h2>
        <p class="lede">전국 {{ national.count }}개 시·군·구 분포 대비 {{ province }}의 위치를 표시했습니다.</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if not is_national %}
    <div class="range-card">
      <div class="range-strip">
        <span style="background:#0D2F6B"></span><span style="background:#1E5AA8"></span>
        <span style="background:#0E7C8A"></span><span style="background:#3DB8E8"></span>
        <span style="background:#7BCB2E"></span><span style="background:#C5D94A"></span>
        <span style="background:#F2E14A"></span><span style="background:#F5B84A"></span>
        <span style="background:#F07A1A"></span><span style="background:#E53935"></span>

        <div class="range-marker below" style="left:{{ national.min }}%"><span class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(national.min) }}</span><span class="lbl">전국 최저</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
        <div class="range-marker" style="left:{{ national.avg }}%"><span class="lbl">전국 평균</span><span class="num">{{ national.avg }}</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
        <div class="range-marker emph below" style="left:{{ province_stat.avg }}%"><span class="num">{{ province_stat.avg }}</span><span class="lbl">{{ province }} 평균</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
        <div class="range-marker" style="left:{{ national.max }}%"><span class="lbl">전국 최고 · {{ national.max_name }}</span><span class="num">{{ "%.1f"|format(national.max) }}</span><span class="stem"></span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="footnote" style="margin-top:0">위험지수 0–100 전 구간 대비 위치 · 색상은 국가산불위험예보 10단계 배색과 동일</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <h3 class="section-label">시·도별 평균 위험지수</h3>
    <div class="prov-list">
      {% for row in province_table %}
      <div class="prov-row{% if row.is_target %} target{% endif %}">
        <span class="name">{{ row.name }}{% if row.is_target %} <span class="badge">{{ row.rank }}위</span>{% endif %}</span>
        <div class="prov-track"><div class="prov-fill" style="width:{{ row.width_pct }}%; background:{{ row.color }}"></div></div>
        <span class="val">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.avg) }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="footnote">지수는 기상 4개 + 시군구 이력 2개 + 건조지수 + 강수파생 3개 변수를 결합한 상대값입니다. 자세한 해석은 방법론 페이지를 참고하세요.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- 4: 상위 지역 상세 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p4">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">주요 지역 상세</h2>
        <p class="lede one-line">위험도 상위 5개 지역의 {% if is_national %}전국 평균({{ national.avg }}){% else %}{{ province }} 평균({{ province_stat.avg }})·전국 평균({{ national.avg }}){% endif %} 대비 위치와 기상 조건을 함께 표시했습니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="spot-list">
      {% for row in spotlight %}
      <div class="spot-row">
        <div class="spot-main">
          <div class="spot-head">
            <span class="spot-rank">{{ row.rank }}</span>
            <span class="spot-name">{{ row.name }}</span>
            <span class="chip"><span class="swatch" style="background:{{ row.color }}"></span>{{ row.band_lo }}–{{ row.band_hi }} 구간{% if row.is_highlight and not row.is_top %} · 조회 지역{% endif %}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spot-idx">{{ "%.1f"|format(row.idx) }}<small> / 100</small></div>
          <div class="compare">
            {% for m in row.marks %}
            <i class="{{ 'self' if m.is_self else '' }}" style="left:{{ m.value }}%"></i>
            <em class="{{ 'self' if m.is_self else '' }}{{ ' below' if m.below else '' }}" style="left:{{ m.value }}%">{{ m.label }}</em>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
        <table class="wx-mini">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>기온</th>
              <th>습도</th>
              <th>풍속</th>
              <th>강수</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(row.weather.temp) }}<small> ℃</small></td>
              <td>{{ row.weather.humidity }}<small> %</small></td>
              <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(row.weather.wind) }}<small> m/s</small></td>
              <td>{{ "%.1f"|format(row.weather.precip) }}<small> mm</small></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5: 해석 및 안내 -->
  <section class="spread" id="p5">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-dot"></span>
      <div class="titles">
        <h2 class="page-title">지수를 읽는 법</h2>
        <p class="lede">예측 지수의 의미와 일반 산불예방 수칙입니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="method-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="copy">
          위험지수는 XGBoost 일별 예측모델의 원시 확률(y_prob)에 100을 곱한 값입니다.
          산불은 매우 드문 사건이라 정밀도가 낮고, <strong>확률 보정(calibration)도 적용되지 않았습니다.</strong><br />
          따라서 이 지수는 "오늘 실제 산불이 날 절대 확률"이 아니라,<br />
          <strong>지역 간 상대적 위험 서열</strong>로 해석하는 것이 안전합니다.
        </p>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>모델</span><span>XGBoost (일별 시군구 단위)</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>ROC-AUC</span><span>{{ "%.4f"|format(metrics.roc_auc) if metrics.roc_auc is not none else "—" }}</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>PR-AUC</span><span>{{ "%.4f"|format(metrics.pr_auc) if metrics.pr_auc is not none else "—" }}</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>확률 보정</span><span>미적용</span></div>
        <div class="stat-line"><span>입력 변수</span><span>기상 4 · 이력 2 · 건조지수 · 강수파생 3</span></div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="section-label">일반 산불예방 수칙</h3>
        <ul class="guide">
          <li>산림 및 인접 지역에서는 화기 사용과 흡연을 자제하세요.</li>
          <li>논밭두렁 소각, 쓰레기 소각 등 실화 요인을 피하세요.</li>
          <li>건조하고 바람이 강한 날에는 입산을 자제하는 것이 안전합니다.</li>
          <li>산불을 발견하면 즉시 119 또는 산림청 산불신고 전화로 신고하세요.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="report-footer">
      <strong>자료 출처</strong> · 기상청 시간자료({{ weather_source }}) 기반 XGBoost 예측 · daily_ml_risk 데이터셋<br />
      <strong>리포트 생성</strong> · {{ generated_at }} · 본 리포트는 머신러닝 예측모델 기반 자동 생성 자료이며, 산림청 등 공식 산불예보와 다를 수 있습니다.
    </div>
  </section>

</div>
</body>
</html>
